OL,3,ATeacher fought US school attacker
OL,4,Abefore armed dad shot suspect 'multiple
OL,5,Atimes'
OL,6,
OL,7,FSome readers may find this article
OL,8,Fdistressing.
OL,10,FA female teacher in the US state of
OL,11,FOregon tackled a teenage shooter who
OL,12,Fentered her classroom and tried to
OL,13,Fwrestle the gun from his grasp, police
OL,14,Fhave said.
OL,16,FThe teacher, who has not been named,
OL,17,Fthrew her mobile phone before trying to
OL,18,Fdisarm the 16-year-old on the floor of
OL,19,Fa classroom at Silver Rail Elementary
OL,20,Fin the city of Bend.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
